%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-urlencoded (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  {
      "name": "Mariano",
      "lastName": "de Achaval"
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload application/x-www-form-urlencoded
name=Mariano&lastName=de+Achaval
%%% output application/dw
{
  name: "Mariano",
  lastName: "de Achaval"
} as Object {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"}
